break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握って、おっさんが行っても良いの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カモン！！待ってるよん❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未さんが描く未来予想図は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひみつーーっ❤！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いと綺麗、どちらの方がより良く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いのがやっぱ嬉しいっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われたーい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回ぐらい握手すれば認知される？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10回以上来てくれれば確実に覚えれる  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突っ込みコメント、ボケコメント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多々しても良い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーけーおーけー(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未さんファンの割合は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（３０代以上はさすがに少ないかな？）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、いろんな年齢層の方が来てくれるから安心して(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまの事をになちまと呼ぶ？ように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバーにも新たなニックネームを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付けているいるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text"